{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 12, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant culture and stunning landscapes that surrounded me.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the bustling market were overwhelming, but the fresh sushi I sampled was well worth it. I also had the opportunity to visit the serene Meiji Shrine, a peaceful oasis in the midst of the bustling city.\n\nAs I traveled to other parts of Japan, I was amazed by the natural beauty of the country. The cherry blossoms were in full bloom, painting the landscape with vibrant pink hues. I took a stroll along the Philosopher's Path in Kyoto, lined with hundreds of blooming trees, and felt a deep sense of tranquility.\n\nJapanese cuisine was also a highlight of my trip. I sampled delicious dishes such as ramen and tempura, and was impressed by the attention to detail and care that went into preparing each meal.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. The unique blend of traditional and modern culture, stunning natural beauty, and delicious cuisine made for a truly unforgettable adventure. I left Japan feeling inspired and already planning my next trip back.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5595460534095764}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004180265124887228}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20428094267845154}, {"token": " sensory", "logprob": -1.5812299251556396}, {"token": " overload", "logprob": -0.035759229212999344}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.00016878610767889768}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.78813775164